// Shared partial pulled in by `include.tyx` through `#include "…"`.
//
// Candy expands every `#include "…"` statement *before* it parses the document,
// so the directives declared here are parsed exactly as if they had been
// written inline inside the includer's `#scene[ … ]`. That means mobjects,
// animations, subtitles, counters, scenes, etc. declared in a partial all
// take part in the animation.
//
// Diagnostic bonus: if a directive here is malformed, the error is reported
// at this file's `#include "…"` line in the includer (the *referenced*
// position) — not at a meaningless offset inside the concatenated document.
//
// Cycle guard: a file may appear at most once along a single include path.
// Including the same file twice on one chain (a → b → a) is rejected as a
// circular include; the same file on two different branches is allowed.

#mobject("shared-box", square(size: 3cm, fill: green, stroke: black))
#animate("shared-box", to: (6cm, 0cm), duration: 1500)
